abel-km" lang="km" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>ភាសាខ្មែរ</bdi>&nbsp;: </span> <a href="https://km.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E1%9E%91%E1%9E%84%E1%9F%8B%E1%9E%87%E1%9E%B6%E1%9E%8F%E1%9E%B7%E1%9E%85%E1%9E%80%E1%9F%92%E1%9E%9A%E1%9E%97%E1%9E%96%E1%9E%A2%E1%9E%84%E1%9F%8B%E1%9E%82%E1%9F%92%E1%9E%9B%E1%9F%81%E1%9E%9F" class="extiw" title="km:ទង់ជាតិចក្រភពអង់គ្លេស">ទង់ជាតិចក្រភពអង់គ្លេស</a></div><div class="description th lang-th" lang="th" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-th" lang="th" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>ไทย</bdi>:</span> <a href="https://th.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3" class="extiw" title="th:ธงชาติสหราชอาณาจักร">ธงชาติสหราชอาณาจักร</a></div><div class="description ko lang-ko" lang="ko" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ko" lang="ko" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>한국어</bdi>: </span> <a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%98%81%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%AD%EA%B8%B0" class="extiw" title="ko:영국의 국기">영국의 국기</a> / <a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%98%81%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%AD%EA%B8%B0" class="extiw" title="ko:영국의 국기">英國의 國旗</a></div><div class="description ja lang-ja" lang="ja" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ja" lang="ja" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>日本語</bdi>：</span> <a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AE%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%81%AE%E5%9B%BD%E6%97%97" class="extiw" title="ja:イギリスの国旗">イギリスの国旗</a></div><div class="description zh lang-zh" lang="zh" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-zh" lang="zh" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>中文</bdi>：</span> <a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%B1%E5%9C%8B%E5%9C%8B%E6%97%97" class="extiw" title="zh:英國國旗">英國國旗</a>，米字旗</div><div class="description he lang-he" lang="he" dir="rtl" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-he" lang="he" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>עברית</bdi>&nbsp;: </span> <a href="https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%93%D7%92%D7%9C_%D7%91%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%98%D7%A0%D7%99%D7%94" class="extiw" title="he:דגל בריטניה">דגל בריטניה</a></div><div class="description ar lang-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ar" lang="ar" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>العربية</bdi>&nbsp;: </span> <a href="https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%85_%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D9%85%D9%84%D9%83%D8%A9_%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D8%AA%D8%AD%D8%AF%D8%A9" class="extiw" title="ar:علم المملكة المتحدة">علم المملكة المتحدة</a>, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%85_%D8%AC%D8%A7%D9%83" class="extiw" title="w:علم جاك">علم جاك</a> أو علم الاتحاد بنسبة 1:2 (هو علم نموذجي على السفن الحربية البريطانية وأيضًا علم رتبة أدميرال الأسطول).</div></div></td>
